{"title":"Qa'idah","credit":"Our own lessons, in the order of the Noorani Qa'idah. Words from the Qur'an in the Indo-Pak script, from the King Fahd Complex's Nastaleeq text (via the public-domain quran-api of fawazahmed0), copied exactly with the pause marks left out.","lessons":[{"n":1,"t":"The letters","ar":"حُرُوفُ التَّهَجِّي","intro":["There are 29 letters. Arabic is read from right to left.","Say each letter's name clearly, looking at its dots: one, two or three, above or below.","Read every row right to left, then top to bottom, until you can name any letter at sight."],"blocks":[{"type":"grid","items":[{"ar":"ا","en":"Alif"},{"ar":"ب","en":"Ba"},{"ar":"ت","en":"Ta"},{"ar":"ث","en":"Tha"},{"ar":"ج","en":"Jim"},{"ar":"ح","en":"Ha"},{"ar":"خ","en":"Kha"},{"ar":"د","en":"Dal"},{"ar":"ذ","en":"Dhal"},{"ar":"ر","en":"Ra"},{"ar":"ز","en":"Zay"},{"ar":"س","en":"Sin"},{"ar":"ش","en":"Shin"},{"ar":"ص","en":"Sad"},{"ar":"ض","en":"Dad"},{"ar":"ط","en":"Ta (heavy)"},{"ar":"ظ","en":"Za (heavy)"},{"ar":"ع","en":"'Ayn"},{"ar":"غ","en":"Ghayn"},{"ar":"ف","en":"Fa"},{"ar":"ق","en":"Qaf"},{"ar":"ك","en":"Kaf"},{"ar":"ل","en":"Lam"},{"ar":"م","en":"Mim"},{"ar":"ن","en":"Nun"},{"ar":"و","en":"Waw"},{"ar":"ه","en":"Ha (light)"},{"ar":"ء","en":"Hamzah"},{"ar":"ي","en":"Ya"}],"size":"xl"}],"quiz":"letters"},{"n":2,"t":"Letters that look alike","ar":"الْحُرُوفُ الْمُتَشَابِهَةُ","intro":["Many letters share a shape and differ only in their dots.","Learn them in their families. Say the name of each one, slowly, and point to its dots."],"blocks":[{"type":"grid","items":[{"ar":"ب   ت   ث"},{"ar":"ج   ح   خ"},{"ar":"د   ذ"},{"ar":"ر   ز"},{"ar":"س   ش"},{"ar":"ص   ض"},{"ar":"ط   ظ"},{"ar":"ع   غ"},{"ar":"ف   ق"},{"ar":"ك   ل"},{"ar":"ه   ء"}],"size":"tri"}],"quiz":"letters"},{"n":3,"t":"Joined letters","ar":"الْحُرُوفُ الْمُرَكَّبَةُ","intro":["In a word, letters join and change shape: at the start, in the middle and at the end.","Six letters never join to the letter after them: ا د ذ ر ز و.","For each letter, read its shapes and name it. Then read the joined pairs, naming each letter: ب ت is 'ba ta'."],"blocks":[{"type":"grid","items":[{"ar":"ا  ـا","en":"Alif"},{"ar":"بـ  ـبـ  ـب","en":"Ba"},{"ar":"تـ  ـتـ  ـت","en":"Ta"},{"ar":"ثـ  ـثـ  ـث","en":"Tha"},{"ar":"جـ  ـجـ  ـج","en":"Jim"},{"ar":"حـ  ـحـ  ـح","en":"Ha"},{"ar":"خـ  ـخـ  ـخ","en":"Kha"},{"ar":"د  ـد","en":"Dal"},{"ar":"ذ  ـذ","en":"Dhal"},{"ar":"ر  ـر","en":"Ra"},{"ar":"ز  ـز","en":"Zay"},{"ar":"سـ  ـسـ  ـس","en":"Sin"},{"ar":"شـ  ـشـ  ـش","en":"Shin"},{"ar":"صـ  ـصـ  ـص","en":"Sad"},{"ar":"ضـ  ـضـ  ـض","en":"Dad"},{"ar":"طـ  ـطـ  ـط","en":"Ta (heavy)"},{"ar":"ظـ  ـظـ  ـظ","en":"Za (heavy)"},{"ar":"عـ  ـعـ  ـع","en":"'Ayn"},{"ar":"غـ  ـغـ  ـغ","en":"Ghayn"},{"ar":"فـ  ـفـ  ـف","en":"Fa"},{"ar":"قـ  ـقـ  ـق","en":"Qaf"},{"ar":"كـ  ـكـ  ـك","en":"Kaf"},{"ar":"لـ  ـلـ  ـل","en":"Lam"},{"ar":"مـ  ـمـ  ـم","en":"Mim"},{"ar":"نـ  ـنـ  ـن","en":"Nun"},{"ar":"و  ـو","en":"Waw"},{"ar":"هـ  ـهـ  ـه","en":"Ha (light)"},{"ar":"يـ  ـيـ  ـي","en":"Ya"}],"size":"tri"},{"type":"p","text":"Joined pairs: name each letter."},{"type":"grid","items":[{"ar":"بت"},{"ar":"تث"},{"ar":"جح"},{"ar":"حخ"},{"ar":"سش"},{"ar":"صض"},{"ar":"طظ"},{"ar":"عغ"},{"ar":"فق"},{"ar":"كل"},{"ar":"لم"},{"ar":"من"},{"ar":"نه"},{"ar":"هي"},{"ar":"يب"},{"ar":"لا"},{"ar":"بل"},{"ar":"عل"},{"ar":"فل"},{"ar":"قل"}],"size":"lg"}]},{"n":4,"t":"The disjoined letters","ar":"الْحُرُوفُ الْمُقَطَّعَاتُ","intro":["Some surahs open with letters read by their names, not as a word: الٓمّٓ is read 'Alif Lam Mim'.","These are from the Qur'an itself. Read each letter's name, lengthening where you see the madd sign ٓ."],"blocks":[{"type":"grid","items":[{"ar":"الٓمّٓ","en":"2:1"},{"ar":"الٓمَّٓ","en":"3:1"},{"ar":"الٓمّٓصٓ","en":"7:1"},{"ar":"الٓرٰ","en":"10:1"},{"ar":"الٓمّٓرٰ","en":"13:1"},{"ar":"كٓهٰيٰعٓصٓ","en":"19:1"},{"ar":"طٰهٰ","en":"20:1"},{"ar":"طٰسٓمّٓ","en":"26:1"},{"ar":"طٰسٓ","en":"27:1"},{"ar":"يٰسٓ","en":"36:1"},{"ar":"صٓ","en":"38:1"},{"ar":"حٰمٓ","en":"40:1"},{"ar":"عٓسٓقٓ","en":"42:2"},{"ar":"قٓ","en":"50:1"},{"ar":"نٓ","en":"68:1"}],"size":"lg"}]},{"n":5,"t":"The harakat","ar":"الْحَرَكَاتُ","intro":["Three short vowels: fatha ( َ ) above the letter reads 'a', kasra ( ِ ) below reads 'i', and dammah ( ُ ) above reads 'u'.","Read them short and crisp, without stretching: بَ ba, بِ bi, بُ bu.","Read each row of three: the letter with fatha, then kasra, then dammah."],"blocks":[{"type":"grid","items":[{"ar":"بَ بِ بُ"},{"ar":"تَ تِ تُ"},{"ar":"ثَ ثِ ثُ"},{"ar":"جَ جِ جُ"},{"ar":"حَ حِ حُ"},{"ar":"خَ خِ خُ"},{"ar":"دَ دِ دُ"},{"ar":"ذَ ذِ ذُ"},{"ar":"رَ رِ رُ"},{"ar":"زَ زِ زُ"},{"ar":"سَ سِ سُ"},{"ar":"شَ شِ شُ"},{"ar":"صَ صِ صُ"},{"ar":"ضَ ضِ ضُ"},{"ar":"طَ طِ طُ"},{"ar":"ظَ ظِ ظُ"},{"ar":"عَ عِ عُ"},{"ar":"غَ غِ غُ"},{"ar":"فَ فِ فُ"},{"ar":"قَ قِ قُ"},{"ar":"كَ كِ كُ"},{"ar":"لَ لِ لُ"},{"ar":"مَ مِ مُ"},{"ar":"نَ نِ نُ"},{"ar":"وَ وِ وُ"},{"ar":"هَ هِ هُ"},{"ar":"يَ يِ يُ"}],"size":"tri"}],"quiz":"harakat"},{"n":6,"t":"Tanween","ar":"التَّنْوِينُ","intro":["Doubled harakat are tanween: they add a 'n' sound. بً ban, بٍ bin, بٌ bun.","A final alif after fathatan (بًا) is not read; it only carries the tanween."],"blocks":[{"type":"grid","items":[{"ar":"بًا بٍ بٌ"},{"ar":"تًا تٍ تٌ"},{"ar":"ثًا ثٍ ثٌ"},{"ar":"جًا جٍ جٌ"},{"ar":"حًا حٍ حٌ"},{"ar":"خًا خٍ خٌ"},{"ar":"دًا دٍ دٌ"},{"ar":"ذًا ذٍ ذٌ"},{"ar":"رًا رٍ رٌ"},{"ar":"زًا زٍ زٌ"},{"ar":"سًا سٍ سٌ"},{"ar":"شًا شٍ شٌ"},{"ar":"صًا صٍ صٌ"},{"ar":"ضًا ضٍ ضٌ"},{"ar":"طًا طٍ طٌ"},{"ar":"ظًا ظٍ ظٌ"},{"ar":"عًا عٍ عٌ"},{"ar":"غًا غٍ غٌ"},{"ar":"فًا فٍ فٌ"},{"ar":"قًا قٍ قٌ"},{"ar":"كًا كٍ كٌ"},{"ar":"لًا لٍ لٌ"},{"ar":"مًا مٍ مٌ"},{"ar":"نًا نٍ نٌ"},{"ar":"وًا وٍ وٌ"},{"ar":"يًا يٍ يٌ"}],"size":"tri"}]},{"n":7,"t":"Reading words: harakat and tanween","ar":"تَمْرِينُ الْحَرَكَاتِ وَالتَّنْوِينِ","intro":["Now read whole words from the Qur'an that use only the harakat and tanween you know.","Read letter by letter first (ba-la-da), then join them smoothly."],"blocks":[{"type":"grid","items":[{"ar":"عَنِ","en":"78:2"},{"ar":"مِنَ","en":"78:14"},{"ar":"اَذِنَ","en":"78:38"},{"ar":"لَهُ","en":"78:38"},{"ar":"هِيَ","en":"79:13"},{"ar":"فَحَشَرَ","en":"79:23"},{"ar":"فَاَخَذَهُ","en":"79:25"},{"ar":"اَمِ","en":"79:27"},{"ar":"رَفَعَ","en":"79:28"},{"ar":"عَبَسَ","en":"80:1"},{"ar":"مَنِ","en":"80:5"},{"ar":"وَهُوَ","en":"80:9"},{"ar":"صُحُفٍ","en":"80:13"},{"ar":"سَفَرَةٍ","en":"80:15"},{"ar":"بَرَرَةٍ","en":"80:16"},{"ar":"قُتِلَ","en":"80:17"},{"ar":"غَبَرَةٌ","en":"80:40"},{"ar":"قَتَرَةٌ","en":"80:41"},{"ar":"هُمُ","en":"80:42"},{"ar":"هُوَ","en":"81:24"},{"ar":"خَلَقَكَ","en":"82:7"},{"ar":"فَعَدَلَكَ","en":"82:7"},{"ar":"وَسَقَ","en":"84:17"},{"ar":"طَبَقٍ","en":"84:19"},{"ar":"قُرِئَ","en":"84:21"},{"ar":"بَلِ","en":"84:22"},{"ar":"خُلِقَ","en":"86:5"},{"ar":"خَلَقَ","en":"87:2"},{"ar":"وَذَكَرَ","en":"87:15"},{"ar":"صُحُفِ","en":"87:19"},{"ar":"سُرُرٌ","en":"88:13"},{"ar":"وَكَفَرَ","en":"88:23"},{"ar":"قَسَمٌ","en":"89:5"},{"ar":"تَرَ","en":"89:6"},{"ar":"فَعَلَ","en":"89:6"},{"ar":"اِرَمَ","en":"89:7"},{"ar":"فَقَدَرَ","en":"89:16"},{"ar":"اَحَدٌ","en":"89:25"},{"ar":"وَلَدَ","en":"90:3"},{"ar":"كَبَدٍ","en":"90:4"}],"size":"lg"}]},{"n":8,"t":"Standing harakat","ar":"الْحَرَكَاتُ الْقَائِمَةُ","intro":["In the Indo-Pak script a standing fatha ( ٰ ), standing kasra ( ٖ ) and inverted dammah ( ٗ ) are read long, for two counts: بٰ baa, بٖ bii, بٗ buu.","They do the work of a madd letter. Don't stretch them more than two counts."],"blocks":[{"type":"grid","items":[{"ar":"بٰ بٖ بٗ"},{"ar":"تٰ تٖ تٗ"},{"ar":"ثٰ ثٖ ثٗ"},{"ar":"جٰ جٖ جٗ"},{"ar":"حٰ حٖ حٗ"},{"ar":"خٰ خٖ خٗ"},{"ar":"دٰ دٖ دٗ"},{"ar":"ذٰ ذٖ ذٗ"},{"ar":"رٰ رٖ رٗ"},{"ar":"زٰ زٖ زٗ"},{"ar":"سٰ سٖ سٗ"},{"ar":"شٰ شٖ شٗ"},{"ar":"صٰ صٖ صٗ"},{"ar":"ضٰ ضٖ ضٗ"},{"ar":"طٰ طٖ طٗ"},{"ar":"ظٰ ظٖ ظٗ"},{"ar":"عٰ عٖ عٗ"},{"ar":"غٰ غٖ غٗ"},{"ar":"فٰ فٖ فٗ"},{"ar":"قٰ قٖ قٗ"},{"ar":"كٰ كٖ كٗ"},{"ar":"لٰ لٖ لٗ"},{"ar":"مٰ مٖ مٗ"},{"ar":"نٰ نٖ نٗ"},{"ar":"وٰ وٖ وٗ"},{"ar":"هٰ هٖ هٗ"},{"ar":"يٰ يٖ يٗ"}],"size":"tri"},{"type":"p","text":"In words from the Qur'an:"},{"type":"grid","items":[{"ar":"مٰلِكِ"},{"ar":"بِهٖ"},{"ar":"ذٰلِكَ"},{"ar":"يَدٰهُ"},{"ar":"وَاٰثَرَ"},{"ar":"لَهٗ"},{"ar":"ذَكَرَهٗ"},{"ar":"خَلَقَهٗ"},{"ar":"اَمَرَهٗ"},{"ar":"رَاٰهُ"},{"ar":"كِتٰبَ"},{"ar":"كِتٰبٌ"},{"ar":"خِتٰمُهٗ"},{"ar":"كِتٰبَهٗ"},{"ar":"فَجَعَلَهٗ"},{"ar":"اٰنِيَةٍ"},{"ar":"سَلٰمٌ"},{"ar":"وَذٰلِكَ"},{"ar":"فَذٰلِكَ"},{"ar":"اِلٰهِ"}],"size":"lg"}]},{"n":9,"t":"The madd and leen letters","ar":"حُرُوفُ الْمَدِّ وَاللِّينِ","intro":["Alif after a fatha, waw with sukun after a dammah, and ya with sukun after a kasra are madd letters: read them long, for two counts. بَا baa, بُوْ buu, بِیْ bii.","Waw or ya with sukun after a fatha are leen letters: read them softly, without stretching and without a jerk. بَوْ baw, بَیْ bay."],"blocks":[{"type":"grid","items":[{"ar":"بَا بُوۡ بِيۡ"},{"ar":"تَا تُوۡ تِيۡ"},{"ar":"ثَا ثُوۡ ثِيۡ"},{"ar":"جَا جُوۡ جِيۡ"},{"ar":"حَا حُوۡ حِيۡ"},{"ar":"خَا خُوۡ خِيۡ"},{"ar":"دَا دُوۡ دِيۡ"},{"ar":"ذَا ذُوۡ ذِيۡ"},{"ar":"رَا رُوۡ رِيۡ"},{"ar":"زَا زُوۡ زِيۡ"},{"ar":"سَا سُوۡ سِيۡ"},{"ar":"شَا شُوۡ شِيۡ"},{"ar":"صَا صُوۡ صِيۡ"},{"ar":"ضَا ضُوۡ ضِيۡ"},{"ar":"طَا طُوۡ طِيۡ"},{"ar":"ظَا ظُوۡ ظِيۡ"},{"ar":"عَا عُوۡ عِيۡ"},{"ar":"غَا غُوۡ غِيۡ"},{"ar":"فَا فُوۡ فِيۡ"},{"ar":"قَا قُوۡ قِيۡ"},{"ar":"كَا كُوۡ كِيۡ"},{"ar":"لَا لُوۡ لِيۡ"},{"ar":"مَا مُوۡ مِيۡ"},{"ar":"نَا نُوۡ نِيۡ"},{"ar":"هَا هُوۡ هِيۡ"}],"size":"tri"},{"type":"p","text":"Madd letters in words from the Qur'an:"},{"type":"grid","items":[{"ar":"صِرَاطَ"},{"ar":"وَلَا"},{"ar":"مِهٰدًا"},{"ar":"سُبَاتًا"},{"ar":"لِبَاسًا"},{"ar":"مَعَاشًا"},{"ar":"شِدَادًا"},{"ar":"سِرَاجًا"},{"ar":"كَانَ"},{"ar":"سَرَابًا"},{"ar":"مَاٰبًا"},{"ar":"لَا"},{"ar":"شَرَابًا"},{"ar":"حِسَابًا"},{"ar":"بِاٰيٰتِنَا"},{"ar":"كِتٰبًا"},{"ar":"عَذَابًا"},{"ar":"مَفَازًا"},{"ar":"دِهَاقًا"},{"ar":"وَمَا"},{"ar":"خِطَابًا"},{"ar":"وَقَالَ"},{"ar":"صَوَابًا"},{"ar":"مَا"},{"ar":"تُرٰبًا"},{"ar":"خَاشِعَةٌ"},{"ar":"ءَاِذَا"},{"ar":"عِظَامًا"},{"ar":"اِذًا"},{"ar":"خَاسِرَةٌ"},{"ar":"فَاِذَا"},{"ar":"فَقَالَ"}],"size":"lg"},{"type":"grid","items":[{"ar":"بَوۡ بَيۡ"},{"ar":"تَوۡ تَيۡ"},{"ar":"ثَوۡ ثَيۡ"},{"ar":"جَوۡ جَيۡ"},{"ar":"حَوۡ حَيۡ"},{"ar":"خَوۡ خَيۡ"},{"ar":"دَوۡ دَيۡ"},{"ar":"ذَوۡ ذَيۡ"},{"ar":"رَوۡ رَيۡ"},{"ar":"زَوۡ زَيۡ"},{"ar":"سَوۡ سَيۡ"},{"ar":"شَوۡ شَيۡ"},{"ar":"صَوۡ صَيۡ"},{"ar":"ضَوۡ ضَيۡ"},{"ar":"طَوۡ طَيۡ"},{"ar":"ظَوۡ ظَيۡ"},{"ar":"عَوۡ عَيۡ"},{"ar":"غَوۡ غَيۡ"},{"ar":"فَوۡ فَيۡ"},{"ar":"قَوۡ قَيۡ"},{"ar":"كَوۡ كَيۡ"},{"ar":"لَوۡ لَيۡ"},{"ar":"مَوۡ مَيۡ"},{"ar":"نَوۡ نَيۡ"},{"ar":"هَوۡ هَيۡ"}],"size":"tri"},{"type":"p","text":"Leen letters in words from the Qur'an:"},{"type":"grid","items":[{"ar":"يَوۡمِ"},{"ar":"عَلَيۡهِمۡ"},{"ar":"غَيۡرِ"},{"ar":"اَوۡتَادًا"},{"ar":"نَوۡمَكُمۡ"},{"ar":"وَبَنَيۡنَا"},{"ar":"فَوۡقَكُمۡ"},{"ar":"يَوۡمَ"},{"ar":"شَيۡءٍ"},{"ar":"اَحۡصَيۡنٰهُ"},{"ar":"بَيۡنَهُمَا"},{"ar":"يٰلَيۡتَنِيۡ"},{"ar":"فِرۡعَوۡنَ"},{"ar":"لَيۡلَهَا"},{"ar":"يَرَوۡنَهَا"},{"ar":"اَوۡ"},{"ar":"عَلَيۡكَ"},{"ar":"بِاَيۡدِيۡ"},{"ar":"يَوۡمَئِذٍ"},{"ar":"عَلَيۡهَا"},{"ar":"لَقَوۡلُ"},{"ar":"بِقَوۡلِ"},{"ar":"شَيۡطٰنٍ"},{"ar":"فَاَيۡنَ"}],"size":"lg"}]},{"n":10,"t":"Madd with hamzah and sukun","ar":"الْمَدُّ","intro":["The madd sign ( ٓ ) means stretch longer than two counts.","Madd muttasil: a hamzah after a madd letter in the same word (جَآءَ): stretch four to five counts. Madd munfasil: the hamzah begins the next word (اِنَّآ اَنْزَلْنٰہُ): two to five counts.","Madd lazim: a sukun or shaddah after the madd letter (الضَّآلِّیْنَ): six counts. Madd 'arid: stopping on a word after a madd letter (نَسْتَعِیْنُ → نَسْتَعِیْنْ): two, four or six counts."],"blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Words with the madd sign:"},{"type":"grid","items":[{"ar":"الضَّآلِّيۡنَ"},{"ar":"يَتَسَآءَلُوۡنَ"},{"ar":"مَآءً"},{"ar":"السَّمَآءُ"},{"ar":"فِيۡهَا٘"},{"ar":"جَزَآءً"},{"ar":"حَدَآئِقَ"},{"ar":"عَطَآءً"},{"ar":"وَالۡمَلٰٓئِكَةُ"},{"ar":"شَآءَ"},{"ar":"اِنَّا٘"},{"ar":"اِلٰ٘ي"},{"ar":"مَآءَهَا"},{"ar":"جَآءَتِ"},{"ar":"الطَّآمَّةُ"},{"ar":"اِنَّمَا٘"},{"ar":"يَلۡبَثُوۡ٘ا"},{"ar":"وَتَوَلّٰ٘ي"},{"ar":"جَآءَهُ"},{"ar":"يَزَّكّٰ٘ي"},{"ar":"جَآءَكَ"},{"ar":"كَلَّا٘"},{"ar":"مَا٘"},{"ar":"طَعَامِهٖ٘"}],"size":"lg"}]},{"n":11,"t":"Sukun (jazm)","ar":"السُّكُونُ","intro":["Sukun ( ۡ ) means the letter has no vowel: join it to the letter before. اَبْ ab, اِبْ ib, اُبْ ub.","Pronounce the letter with sukun clearly, from its own place in the mouth."],"blocks":[{"type":"grid","items":[{"ar":"اَبۡ اِبۡ اُبۡ"},{"ar":"اَتۡ اِتۡ اُتۡ"},{"ar":"اَثۡ اِثۡ اُثۡ"},{"ar":"اَجۡ اِجۡ اُجۡ"},{"ar":"اَحۡ اِحۡ اُحۡ"},{"ar":"اَخۡ اِخۡ اُخۡ"},{"ar":"اَدۡ اِدۡ اُدۡ"},{"ar":"اَذۡ اِذۡ اُذۡ"},{"ar":"اَرۡ اِرۡ اُرۡ"},{"ar":"اَزۡ اِزۡ اُزۡ"},{"ar":"اَسۡ اِسۡ اُسۡ"},{"ar":"اَشۡ اِشۡ اُشۡ"},{"ar":"اَصۡ اِصۡ اُصۡ"},{"ar":"اَضۡ اِضۡ اُضۡ"},{"ar":"اَطۡ اِطۡ اُطۡ"},{"ar":"اَظۡ اِظۡ اُظۡ"},{"ar":"اَعۡ اِعۡ اُعۡ"},{"ar":"اَغۡ اِغۡ اُغۡ"},{"ar":"اَفۡ اِفۡ اُفۡ"},{"ar":"اَقۡ اِقۡ اُقۡ"},{"ar":"اَكۡ اِكۡ اُكۡ"},{"ar":"اَلۡ اِلۡ اُلۡ"},{"ar":"اَمۡ اِمۡ اُمۡ"},{"ar":"اَنۡ اِنۡ اُنۡ"},{"ar":"اَهۡ اِهۡ اُهۡ"}],"size":"tri"}]},{"n":12,"t":"Reading words with sukun","ar":"تَمْرِينُ السُّكُونِ","intro":["Words from the Qur'an with sukun. Read them in syllables first, then smoothly.","Qalqalah: the letters ق ط ب ج د with sukun bounce slightly: اَقْ, اَطْ, اَبْ, اَجْ, اَدْ."],"blocks":[{"type":"grid","items":[{"ar":"بِسۡمِ"},{"ar":"اَلۡحَمۡدُ"},{"ar":"يَوۡمِ"},{"ar":"نَعۡبُدُ"},{"ar":"نَسۡتَعِيۡنُ"},{"ar":"اِهۡدِنَا"},{"ar":"اَنۡعَمۡتَ"},{"ar":"عَلَيۡهِمۡ"},{"ar":"غَيۡرِ"},{"ar":"فِيۡهِ"},{"ar":"مُخۡتَلِفُوۡنَ"},{"ar":"سَيَعۡلَمُوۡنَ"},{"ar":"اَلَمۡ"},{"ar":"نَجۡعَلِ"},{"ar":"اَوۡتَادًا"},{"ar":"اَزۡوَاجًا"},{"ar":"نَوۡمَكُمۡ"},{"ar":"وَبَنَيۡنَا"},{"ar":"فَوۡقَكُمۡ"},{"ar":"سَبۡعًا"},{"ar":"اَلۡفَافًا"},{"ar":"يَوۡمَ"},{"ar":"مِيۡقَاتًا"},{"ar":"يُنۡفَخُ"},{"ar":"اَفۡوَاجًا"},{"ar":"فَكَانَتۡ"},{"ar":"اَبۡوَابًا"},{"ar":"كَانَتۡ"},{"ar":"مِرۡصَادًا"},{"ar":"اَح